ds at the door like a prayer laid bare"},{"s":32.1,"e":34.12,"text":"FBI van parked by the curbside edge"},{"s":34.18,"e":35.78,"text":"Juggalos laugh on the chain-link ledge"},{"s":35.7,"e":37.56,"text":"Time travelers blink, then they vanish clean"},{"s":37.48,"e":39.3,"text":"Like a bad dream folding in the scene"},{"s":39.36,"e":41.18,"text":"Ain't your hands draw signs and the dust on stone?"},{"s":41.1,"e":42.88,"text":"Multi-sentient voices in one throat tone"},{"s":42.96,"e":46.74,"text":"Aliens lean in with a silver grin, say, you've been lost but you still fit in"},{"s":46.66,"e":50.28,"text":"Angels above me, demons below"},{"s":50.2,"e":53.36,"text":"Djinn in the hallway, tell me what I know"},{"s":54.2,"e":57,"text":"Souls in the rafters, ghosts in the rain"},{"s":57.46,"e":60.94,"text":"All of them call me back to my name"},{"s":62.34,"e":64.8,"text":"Under the stars"},{"s":66.34,"e":68.26,"text":"Tattooed on my scars"},{"s":69.88,"e":72.16,"text":"Heaven and hell"},{"s":73.28,"e":75.28,"text":"Sleep in the mines"},{"s":82.28,"e":83.96,"text":"At the soup line, everybody got a cold"},{"s":84.24,"e":85.76,"text":"Bread in a bowl and a map to the road"},{"s":85.76,"e":87.6,"text":"A cop and a tie and a clown with a crown"},{"s":87.52,"e":89.2,"text":"Both keep staring like they know this town"},{"s":89.12,"e":90.8,"text":"An alien child with a paper plate"},{"s":90.98,"e":92.62,"text":"Asks if the end is just a change of state"},{"s":92.6,"e":94.04,"text":"I said, maybe if the moon says so"},{"s":93.96,"e":96.28,"text":"Then the walls lit up with a soft white glow"},{"s":96.2,"e":99.84,"text":"Ghost in the corner, she tapped my sleeve, said, don't trust the ones who promise leave"},{"s":99.76,"e":103.88,"text":"A demon smile with a borrowed face, an angel cried in a flawless place"},{"s":104.62,"e":107.04,"text":"Angels above me, demons below"},{"s":107.78,"e":110.6,"text":"Djinn in the hallway, tell me what I know"},{"s":111.08,"e":114.8,"text":"Souls in the rafters, ghosts in the rain"},{"s":114.72,"e":118.06,"text":"All of them call me back to my name"},{"s":118.8,"e":122.44,"text":"All in, all in, under the stars"},{"s":122.36,"e":125.82,"text":"All in, all in, tattooed on my scars"},{"s":125.74,"e":129.64,"text":"All in, all in, heaven and hell"},{"s":129.56,"e":132.64,"text":"Sleeping in my arms"},{"s":145.5,"e":150.26,"text":"I seen the old rice in the basement ring"},{"s":150.18,"e":153.78,"text":"Saw twelve moons rise from a paper king"},{"s":153.7,"e":157.38,"text":"Saw one face split into three, then four"},{"s":157.3,"e":160.88,"text":"Then the room went still like an open door"},{"s":160.8,"e":163.7,"text":"If you're a sinner, if you made a light"},{"s":164.06,"e":167.66,"text":"If you came from ash, or you came from night"},{"s":167.58,"e":170.86,"text":"If you're here to stay, or just passing through"},{"s":170.78,"e":176.84,"text":"The sky keeps room for the strange and true"},{"s":177.86,"e":181.5,"text":"All in, all in, under the stars"},{"s":181.42,"e":184.6,"text":"All in, all in, tattooed on my scars"},{"s":185.32,"e":188.7,"text":"All in, all in, heaven and hell"},{"s":188.62,"e":191.62,"text":"All in, all in, sleeping in my arms"},{"s":191.68,"e":195.48,"text":"Souls and ghosts and names unseen"},{"s":195.4,"e":200.56,"text":"All that falls between the beams, under the stars"},{"s":200.48,"e":206.08,"text":"I still believe there's room for you and room for me"}],"duration":222.72,"source":"whisper","generatedAt":"2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z"}